# VPS deploy

After finishing storefront or site work, **commit, push, and deploy to the VPS without asking**. Do not wait for a separate “please deploy” message.

## Sequence

1. Commit only the files that belong to the change (never `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, or `.env`).
2. `git push origin HEAD`
3. On the VPS (`root@195.200.14.123`, app at `/var/www/estepa-workwear`):

```
cd /var/www/estepa-workwear && git pull --ff-only origin main && npm run build && pm2 restart estepa --update-env
```

